1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,160
Good afternoon, FitZone Gym.
This is Jake. How can I help you?

2
00:00:04,644 --> 00:00:09,840
Hi, I'm thinking about joining and I
had a few questions before I sign up.

3
00:00:10,004 --> 00:00:11,040
Sure, go ahead.

4
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:16,180
So I saw online you have three
levels, off-peak, standard and premium.

5
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:20,580
I don't think I need premium, so
could you tell me about standard first?

6
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:25,120
Of course. Standard gives you the
gym floor and, this is the big one,

7
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:29,740
it includes all our group classes,
so spin, yoga, that kind of thing.

8
00:00:30,145 --> 00:00:34,920
Pool access is only with premium and
a personal trainer is extra on every plan.

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:39,280
Great. What time do you open on weekdays?
I like to go before work.

10
00:00:39,525 --> 00:00:43,500
We open at 6am, Monday through Friday.
On weekends, it's 8.

11
00:00:43,909 --> 00:00:46,940
Perfect. And, um, is there a joining fee?

12
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:52,000
There's normally a $50 joining fee,
but right now it's been reduced to $35.

13
00:00:52,669 --> 00:00:57,320
Oh, nice. Do you offer a student discount?
I'm doing a part-time master's.

14
00:00:57,510 --> 00:01:02,160
We do. It used to be 15%, but
it's now 20% off the monthly fee.

15
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:03,860
Are you open on Sundays too?

16
00:01:04,179 --> 00:01:07,740
Yep. We're open 7 days a week.
We only close on public holidays.

17
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:10,486
What do I need to
bring on my first visit?

18
00:01:10,510 --> 00:01:12,992
Do I need a doctor's
note or anything like that?

19
00:01:13,249 --> 00:01:16,280
No doctor's note.
You just fill in a short health form here.

20
00:01:16,689 --> 00:01:19,580
Bring photo ID though, so we
can set up your membership card.

21
00:01:19,864 --> 00:01:22,240
Okay. Is there a minimum contract?

22
00:01:22,829 --> 00:01:27,520
Our shortest contract is three months.
We used to ask for six, but not any more.

23
00:01:27,859 --> 00:01:29,740
After three months, it's month to month.

24
00:01:30,084 --> 00:01:32,860
And if I had to leave before
the three months were up?

25
00:01:33,119 --> 00:01:36,120
Then you'd just pay one month's
fee as a cancellation charge.

26
00:01:36,454 --> 00:01:38,280
There's no deposit or anything to lose.

27
00:01:38,639 --> 00:01:41,140
That's fair. Which classes are the busiest?

28
00:01:41,629 --> 00:01:43,320
A friend told me spin fills up.

29
00:01:43,859 --> 00:01:46,120
On most evenings, it's actually yoga.

30
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:49,520
But on Monday evenings,
spin is always the most popular.

31
00:01:49,964 --> 00:01:51,600
Everyone's making up for the weekend.

32
00:01:52,509 --> 00:01:53,540
I know the feeling.

33
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:55,140
Where are the lockers?

34
00:01:55,379 --> 00:01:57,657
The changing rooms are
down in the basement, but the

35
00:01:57,681 --> 00:02:00,192
lockers are on the ground
floor, right next to reception.

36
00:02:00,579 --> 00:02:04,900
Is the pool heated? I know it's
premium only, but I might upgrade later.

37
00:02:05,399 --> 00:02:08,767
It is. We used to keep
it at 26 degrees Celsius,

38
00:02:08,791 --> 00:02:12,172
but people said it was
too cold, so now it's 28.

39
00:02:12,790 --> 00:02:15,540
Is personal training included
for new members at all?

40
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:20,220
Every new member gets one free session
with a trainer. After that, it's paid.

41
00:02:20,745 --> 00:02:21,940
How do most people pay?

42
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,360
Most people pay monthly by card.

43
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:28,340
But if you pay for the whole year by
bank transfer, you get a better rate.

44
00:02:28,740 --> 00:02:30,560
We don't take cash for memberships.

45
00:02:30,954 --> 00:02:34,080
Good to know.
What time do the last classes finish?

46
00:02:34,524 --> 00:02:37,720
The last class starts at
8 and finishes at 9pm.

47
00:02:38,230 --> 00:02:40,180
The gym itself stays open until 10.

48
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,700
Is there anything I need
to know about the sauna?

49
00:02:43,230 --> 00:02:45,540
You don't need to book,
and towels are provided.

50
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:48,320
We just ask everyone to
shower before going in.

51
00:02:48,655 --> 00:02:50,860
And guest passes? Do I get any?

52
00:02:51,270 --> 00:02:52,780
Not with standard, I'm afraid.

53
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:56,760
Off-peak members get one a year,
and premium members get four.

54
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,020
A couple more things.
Is parking on the street?

55
00:03:00,550 --> 00:03:03,530
Street parking is tricky around
here, but we have our own

56
00:03:03,554 --> 00:03:06,652
parking lot behind the building,
and it's free for members.

57
00:03:07,150 --> 00:03:10,240
My son is 15.
Could he use the gym on his own?

58
00:03:10,690 --> 00:03:12,863
He can come in with
you, but members need

59
00:03:12,887 --> 00:03:15,232
to be 16 to use the
gym without supervision.

60
00:03:15,790 --> 00:03:19,780
Right. And that reduced
joining fee, how long does it last?

61
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:22,220
That offer ends at the end of this month.

62
00:03:22,564 --> 00:03:24,480
Next month, it goes back up to 50.

63
00:03:25,020 --> 00:03:26,540
Then I'd better come in this week.

64
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:28,260
Thanks so much, Jake.

65
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,600
You're welcome, Priya.

66
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,880
See you soon.

